# Recovered C1XX C++ grammar. Rule order and lexer token identities are ABI data.
# Empty productions with *_begin/end names are original midrule semantic actions.
# This source regenerates the automaton; it contains no original packed tables.
%start translation_unit

%token IDENTIFIER 2
%token STRING_LITERAL 3
%token VIRTUAL 18
%token SEGNAME 27
%token CLASS_HEAD 38
